seesOtherDevices.description:
Whether the caller sees the other devices here (the local gateway,
S1-7): who manages the link, or a local account it let see them;
nobody while local authentication is off.

ReceiptLookup.description:
The answer to `GET /api/sessions/{source}/{id}/receipts`.

An id in neither list is one whose first attempt is still being accepted;
ask again.
